    "question": {
      "question_id": "FIELD-SEED-001",
      "normalized_question": "An Allen-Bradley SLC 5/03 is on a DH-485 network. A technician wants to replace the existing protocol-aware interface with a USR-N540 transparent RS-485-to-Ethernet converter. After the swap the PLC stops communicating. Why does this happen and what should be checked first?",
